/*
 * UnitTestExpander — expands unittest blocks and unittest registration frames.
 *
 * The UnitTestExpander lowers unittest constructs into YILFrame nodes. It handles:
 *
 *   - generation of a frame for each unittest block,
 *   - insertion of unittest frames into the global symbol table,
 *   - generation of a package-level registration frame listing all unittests,
 *   - generation of the synthetic main() entry frame used when running unittests.
 *
 * Unittest frames are emitted only when unittest mode is active. Each unittest
 * is compiled into a standalone frame with no parameters and a void return type.

 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::unittest
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/unittest.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-24
